cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "BayesTS: Bayesian time series estimation in C++"
abstract: >-
  A C++ library of Gibbs samplers for Bayesian multivariate time series
  models, driven either from the command line or from an embedded host such
  as an R package. Twenty algorithms span vector autoregressions, quantile
  VARs, vector error correction models, dynamic factor models and a factor
  augmented VAR. The numerical core performs no input or output and holds no
  global state beyond the random number generator, and one HDF5 model file
  holds the data, priors, starting values and results of one model.
type: software
authors:
